## Professional .NET / C# Gitignore

# --------- Build Artifacts ---------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# --------- Visual Studio (VS) Temporary Files ---------
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# --------- JetBrains Rider / Resharper ---------
.idea/
*.sln.DotSettings.user

# --------- NuGet Packages ---------
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
# If using a local 'packages' folder (older .NET Framework style)
packages/

# --------- OS Generated Files ---------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --------- User / Environment Secrets ---------
*.usersecret
.env
appsettings.Development.json
